Usage: castloop import-rss SHOW_ID FEED_URL (--dry-run | --output DIRECTORY)

Import one RSS 2.0 podcast to local files without Cloudflare credentials or changes.
--dry-run fetches only RSS and reports counts, missing fields and unsupported extensions.
--output downloads the RSS snapshot, JPEG/PNG cover, MP3s and editable TOML into an empty directory.
Repeat the same command to continue this snapshot without overwriting edited TOML.
Preserve downloaded files and private .castloop records; review them before publication.
Audio must be MP3 and at most 300,000,000 bytes. Local import does not migrate subscribers or remove the old host.

Options:
  --help, -h  Show this help
